рядом уже давно появился симпатичный компаньон.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1206639","ru":"Собачья жизнь: Друзья навек","en":"再见，李可乐","year":"2023","type":"Фильм","rating":7.7,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1rbMt821oLlQRYOBH972CM19Vep.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/68Ir38Whl1zdj4AizesHHokLRbE.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"Когда в семье наступают непростые времена, на помощь приходит очаровательный щенок по кличке Кола. Новый друг способен вдохнуть жизнь и научить людей искренней любви и преданности.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1551507","ru":"Svadba","en":"Svadba","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":7.7,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2NaiiFPxzBc3JunKJcqkVI6LKA1.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pD4g0Ks7HwCOReVRkPkL3XxbOml.jpg","genres":["комедия","мелодрама"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"726653","ru":"サイレント・トーキョー","en":"サイレント・トーキョー","year":"2020","type":"Фильм","rating":7.7,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2LUp2mWOq28JGwWZENnzYqAIWol.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s7YaofwKcsXY9cSEXL4sKMscZRw.jpg","genres":["триллер"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1309057","ru":"ゆきてかへらぬ","en":"ゆきてかへらぬ","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":7.7,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4WtoiQiCCZEfgGez5imRvhKCWy.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Yre4voE0qt1MEZW1xbRUjHNchi.jpg","genres":["мелодрама","драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1010628","ru":"In Love with My Partner's Wife","en":"In Love with My Partner's Wife","year":"2022","type":"Фильм","rating":7.7,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7d53PAINezFyAatOeseLggypOtA.jpg","backdrop":"ht